  <name>Superpaper</name>
  <summary>Multi-monitor wallpaper manager</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Superpaper is a cross-platform wallpaper manager that focuses on
      multi-monitor support. It can span a single image across several displays
      and manage per-monitor wallpapers.
    </p>
    <p>Features include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Spanning a single wallpaper across multiple monitors</li>
      <li>Per-monitor PPI and bezel corrections for seamless spans</li>
      <li>Slideshow with configurable interval and ordering</li>
      <li>Global keyboard shortcuts</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
